1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Karen was born  in 1849 or 1850 in Fredrikstad, ØSTFOLD County, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her name is written in several different ways in historical documents, sometimes using her mother's last name, or her father's, or Welhaven's.
2 CONT * Karen Mouler Welhaven
2 CONT * Karen Møller
2 CONT * Karen Sissenere
2 CONT
2 CONT She is described as being of Danish descent or being a Danishwoman. Her father and paternal grandfather Sissenere were French emigres involved in the military. Her mother, Maren Isidore Christiane Møller, was born in Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen married Johan Ernst Welhaven and had children Finn and Alf.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://records.ancestry.com/johan_ernst_welhaven_records.ashx?pid=189833441 Johan Ernst Welhaven Born on 4 May 1848 to Johan Sebastian Welhaven and Josephine Bidoulac. Johan Ernst married Karen Sissenere. He passed away on 21 Oct 
2 CONC 1924. Family Members Parents Johan Sebastian Welhaven 1807-1873 Josephine Bidoulac 1812-1865 Spouse(s) Karen Sissenere
