1 NAME Helene /Frandzdatter/
2 GIVN Helene
2 SURN Frandzdatter
2 _MARNM Heiberg
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE SEP 1660
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 MAY 1741
