2 CONT *[http://genealogy.euweb.cz/reuss/reuss6.html#A24 EUweb H1]
2 CONT * Known as '''Prinz Ruzzo Reuß''> Was a Swedish-Swiss landscape architect and a prince of the former sovereign House of Reuß, which ruled the principalitles of Reuß for almost 800 years.
2 CONT * His family branch was the royal family of the Principålity of Reuß Younger Linie untill 1918.
2 CONT * He was married to former ABBA singer Anni-Frid Lyngstad, who became Frida Princess Reuß due to the marrige.
